OL,3,GNEWSASite for community bike hub
OL,4,A'stormed' by vandals
OL,5,
OL,6,FA site where a new community bike hub
OL,7,Fis being built to help reduce
OL,8,Fantisocial behaviour has been
OL,9,Fvandalised.
OL,11,FPolice are investigating after the
OL,12,FBelieve Achieve CIC project in
OL,13,FStoneclough, Bolton, was targeted on
OL,14,FMonday night.
OL,16,FThe bike hub was being built after
OL,17,Freports of young people in the area
OL,18,Fusing illegal motorised bikes - and the
OL,19,Fgroup aims to give youngsters access to
OL,20,Fbicycles while teaching road safety and
OL,21,Fmaintenance skills.
OL,23,APub: 21-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
