OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,-. *,$%**,%-,* %%**,! ,,
OL,3,GNEWSASite for community bike hub
OL,4,A'stormed' by vandals
OL,5,
OL,6,FTunde Olasupo, project founder, says
OL,7,Fthe site was "stormed" by people who
OL,8,Fvandalised a surrounding fence and
OL,9,Fforcibly opened a container that will
OL,10,Fhouse the hub. They added there had
OL,11,Fbeen opposition to the project, with
OL,12,Fconcerns about further antisocial
OL,13,Fbehaviour.
